@startuml ledger-api-endpoints
title ledger.api — LedgerController routes

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package ledger.api {
  class LedgerController

  package dto {
    class AccountBalanceResponse
    class AccountDetailResponse
    class JournalEntryResponse
  }
}

LedgerController --> AccountBalanceResponse : "GET /api/ledger/accounts\nList"
LedgerController --> AccountDetailResponse : "GET /api/ledger/accounts/{code}"
LedgerController --> JournalEntryResponse : "GET /api/ledger/journal\nList"

note right of LedgerController
  code is a chart code such as 2100.
  Journal list is oldest first.
end note

@enduml
